WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:58.610
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:58.880 --> 04:00.600
Where is that shameless daughter-in-law?

3
04:07.760 --> 04:10.400
Thotsaphon and I searched every room,

4
04:10.480 --> 04:12.200
but we couldn't find Hathai anywhere.

5
04:12.720 --> 04:14.440
Unless…

6
04:14.520 --> 04:17.920
I mean, I'm not sure if Hathai…

7
04:18.000 --> 04:19.399
Where do you think she is?

8
04:22.920 --> 04:25.800
I think Hathai might be sleeping with Dech.

9
04:27.880 --> 04:29.280
She would never do such a thing.

10
04:30.680 --> 04:31.840
You're slandering my wife.

11
04:31.920 --> 04:35.680
I've heard the servants gossiping about this for a long time,

12
04:35.760 --> 04:37.400
but I never said anything

13
04:37.480 --> 04:39.800
because I didn't want to cause problems in your family.

14
04:40.480 --> 04:42.880
But today, Hathai disappeared with Dech.

15
04:43.480 --> 04:45.440
That's why I called Father.

16
04:45.520 --> 04:49.440
I didn't want your wife to bring any more disgrace on the family.

17
04:49.520 --> 04:53.560
You said the servants were gossiping, but you've never seen anything.

18
04:55.000 --> 04:57.760
You can't just repeat whatever other people say.

19
04:57.840 --> 05:00.240
I know you resent

20
05:00.320 --> 05:02.080
being only the second daughter-in-law

21
05:03.440 --> 05:06.440
because Hathai holds all the authority in this house.

22
05:07.120 --> 05:09.280
That's why you want to get rid of her.

23
05:10.240 --> 05:13.440
If you think I made all of this up to frame Hathai,

24
05:14.520 --> 05:17.960
then I'll take responsibility, and I'll be the one to leave this house.

25
05:20.040 --> 05:23.480
Everyone, please calm down. This could all be a misunderstanding.

26
05:24.480 --> 05:25.600
Father,

27
05:26.200 --> 05:27.920
I'll go check Dech's room myself.

28
05:28.000 --> 05:31.720
No. I'll see it with my own eyes.

29
05:32.680 --> 05:36.120
If that shameless in-law has done something filthy under my roof,

30
05:38.520 --> 05:39.800
I won't keep her here either.

31
05:56.400 --> 05:59.280
Ann, your mistress

32
05:59.360 --> 06:01.520
is getting thrown out of the mansion today.

33
06:01.600 --> 06:03.480
She'll end up like a stray dog on the street.

34
06:44.560 --> 06:45.400
Father!

35
06:46.200 --> 06:47.440
You shameless woman!

36
06:57.520 --> 06:59.720
Do you realize what you've done?!

37
07:00.640 --> 07:01.880
-Sir-- -You bastard!

38
07:02.560 --> 07:05.680
-Sir, please. -You bite the hand that feeds you!

39
07:06.880 --> 07:07.720
You--

40
07:07.800 --> 07:09.760
Burapha, calm down! Please, calm down!

41
07:09.840 --> 07:12.560
If you kill him, you'll have to pay for it too.

42
07:12.640 --> 07:14.280
Who's going to take care of your kid?

43
07:14.960 --> 07:18.320
I'm sorry, sir. I was wrong.

44
07:19.680 --> 07:20.720
Dech.

45
07:21.280 --> 07:24.080
Pack your things and get out of my house right now,

46
07:24.720 --> 07:25.760
before I kill you.

47
07:29.440 --> 07:30.280
Calm down, bro.

48
07:33.720 --> 07:35.760
Get dressed and come see me.

49
07:46.280 --> 07:49.440
Burapha, please. Please listen to me first.

50
07:49.520 --> 07:53.080
Please, listen to me. Please!

51
07:54.240 --> 07:55.080
Hathai.

52
07:56.320 --> 07:57.800
I understand.

53
07:57.880 --> 08:00.600
Desire is hard to control.

54
08:00.680 --> 08:02.840
You could've gotten yourself a room at a luxurious

55
08:02.920 --> 08:05.680
five-star hotel. You should've chosen somewhere

56
08:05.760 --> 08:08.000
befitting the dignity of the eldest daughter-in-law.

57
08:08.080 --> 08:10.760
Instead, you did it in a worker's room.

58
08:10.840 --> 08:13.680
You've made yourself look like

59
08:13.760 --> 08:15.960
a street prostitute.

60
08:24.560 --> 08:25.880
Where is that slut?

61
08:26.840 --> 08:28.120
Drag her in here right now!

62
08:33.480 --> 08:34.440
Hathai,

63
08:35.640 --> 08:36.960
how did things come to this?

64
08:38.159 --> 08:39.559
Was I not good enough to you?

65
08:40.640 --> 08:41.760
Tell me.

66
08:44.760 --> 08:46.680
You've treated me well in every way.

67
08:48.200 --> 08:51.840
Better than any husband could treat his wife.

68
08:51.920 --> 08:53.880
Then why did you sleep with him?

69
08:54.680 --> 08:56.120
Did Dech drug you?

70
08:57.480 --> 08:58.720
Did he force himself on you?

71
08:59.880 --> 09:03.080
I'll call the police myself.

72
09:03.160 --> 09:04.680
There's no need.

73
09:07.840 --> 09:10.120
I slept with Dech willingly.

74
09:13.880 --> 09:15.160
This wasn't the first time, right?

75
09:29.360 --> 09:30.480
I'm sorry.

76
09:32.000 --> 09:35.480
I'm so sorry. I truly am.

77
09:36.920 --> 09:37.960
Why?

78
09:39.800 --> 09:41.800
Why would you do this to me?

79
09:41.880 --> 09:43.520
I'm sorry.

80
09:43.600 --> 09:46.960
I'm so sorry.

81
09:47.680 --> 09:49.240
Well, Burapha?

82
09:50.240 --> 09:52.040
Have your eyes finally opened?

83
09:53.040 --> 09:56.880
Now do you understand why I told you not to marry a restaurant hostess?

84
09:58.440 --> 10:01.960
The moment I saw you, I knew exactly what kind of woman you were.

85
10:02.760 --> 10:05.600
You got yourself pregnant on purpose so you could trap my son.

86
10:06.920 --> 10:09.960
I let you live in this house because I love my son and my granddaughter.

87
10:10.840 --> 10:12.640
They are my own blood.

88
10:13.240 --> 10:15.840
And now you've finally shown your true colors.

89
10:15.920 --> 10:18.080
You're an unfaithful wife who has humiliated her husband.

90
10:19.200 --> 10:22.640
Aren't you even going to ask me

91
10:22.720 --> 10:24.800
why I became this way?

92
10:24.880 --> 10:26.600
Because you really are a parasite.

93
10:27.440 --> 10:29.920
You only care about living comfortably. You don't want to work.

94
10:30.000 --> 10:32.280
Every day of your life, you live off others.

95
10:32.360 --> 10:34.560
You latch onto people like a parasite clinging to a tree,

96
10:34.640 --> 10:36.200
sucking away their money.

97
10:36.280 --> 10:38.920
How many millions has my son spent on you already?

98
10:39.000 --> 10:42.240
Luckily, we caught you before you could drain him dry.

99
10:43.000 --> 10:44.720
Your time is up.

100
10:44.800 --> 10:46.920
Get out of my house, you parasite!

101
10:47.880 --> 10:49.680
I've always known

102
10:50.200 --> 10:52.480
ever since I came to live in this house,

103
10:53.200 --> 10:56.080
one day I'd be thrown out.

104
10:57.960 --> 11:00.480
But I want you to know something.

105
11:01.360 --> 11:03.800
The reason my family fell apart is because of you.

106
11:03.880 --> 11:05.400
Don't you dare blame me.

107
11:06.560 --> 11:09.040
Ever since I moved into this house,

108
11:11.320 --> 11:14.920
all you've ever done is look for reasons to accuse me.

109
11:15.000 --> 11:16.800
You were always convinced I would cheat on him.

110
11:16.880 --> 11:19.040
And was I wrong?

111
11:19.720 --> 11:21.720
No woman wants to be

112
11:21.800 --> 11:25.360
branded an adulteress. No woman wants to be treated like a loose woman.

113
11:26.840 --> 11:28.160
I know

114
11:28.240 --> 11:31.360
you hate women who work in nightlife.

115
11:32.120 --> 11:35.600
But I tried to behave well in every way.

116
11:35.680 --> 11:37.920
I wanted everyone to love me.

117
11:38.000 --> 11:39.800
Yet you were prejudiced against me because

118
11:40.600 --> 11:44.440
you believed someone beneath you could only come here to take advantage of you.

119
11:45.840 --> 11:48.280
No matter how good I tried to be,

120
11:48.360 --> 11:51.960
you never once opened your heart to accept me.

121
11:52.040 --> 11:53.520
That's why

122
11:53.600 --> 11:56.160
you did everything you could

123
11:56.800 --> 11:59.000
to keep me away from Burapha.

124
12:02.080 --> 12:04.200
You sent him to work

125
12:04.280 --> 12:07.120
on a housing development project in another province.

126
12:08.200 --> 12:10.280
All the while, you kept looking for another woman

127
12:10.360 --> 12:12.520
to replace me as your daughter-in-law.

128
12:14.000 --> 12:16.640
Just like today, when he went to dinner

129
12:16.720 --> 12:18.560
with the gold shop owner's daughter.

130
12:18.640 --> 12:20.680
Do you think I'm stupid?

131
12:21.280 --> 12:22.520
How did you know about that?

132
12:23.200 --> 12:24.080
Because of her!

133
12:25.000 --> 12:26.720
Your second daughter-in-law.

134
12:28.000 --> 12:30.040
She runs her own personal news agency,

135
12:30.120 --> 12:32.680
reporting everything to me

136
12:32.760 --> 12:34.680
just so I'll die of heartbreak.

137
12:34.760 --> 12:38.240
Everyone in this house hates me.

138
12:38.320 --> 12:40.120
You all want me gone.

139
12:43.720 --> 12:45.640
That's not true, Hathai.

140
12:45.720 --> 12:48.760
I've always been on your side.

141
12:49.280 --> 12:51.440
I'm a daughter-in-law too.

142
12:51.520 --> 12:53.040
We're in the same position.

143
12:53.120 --> 12:55.280
We're family.

144
12:55.360 --> 12:56.200
You lying bitch!

145
12:56.960 --> 12:59.160
You're the worst one of all.

146
12:59.240 --> 13:02.000
You think you're special because Father hand-picked you,

147
13:02.080 --> 13:04.600
so you kiss up to him every chance you get.

148
13:06.040 --> 13:07.640
But Father

149
13:07.720 --> 13:10.880
loves my daughter more than yours,

150
13:10.960 --> 13:12.600
and that eats you alive.

151
13:12.680 --> 13:16.280
You're scared she'll get everything. That's why you've been backstabbing me.

152
13:18.200 --> 13:19.280
Father.

153
13:20.640 --> 13:22.760
I've never thought anything like that.

154
13:24.040 --> 13:26.440
Hathai is slandering me.

155
13:27.400 --> 13:30.520
You want to prove it? Come swear at nine temples with me.

156
13:31.920 --> 13:33.440
Whoever is lying,

157
13:33.520 --> 13:35.440
may they die a horrible death and never be reborn.

158
13:35.520 --> 13:37.720
Enough! That's enough!

159
13:38.520 --> 13:41.880
Get out of my house. I'm sick of looking at you.

160
13:41.960 --> 13:44.200
I'm leaving, Father.

161
13:44.280 --> 13:45.720
I'm sick and tired

162
13:45.800 --> 13:48.680
of letting everyone call me a parasite.

163
13:53.120 --> 13:56.640
But I'm not leaving alone.

164
13:59.320 --> 14:01.720
I'm taking my daughter with me.

165
14:01.800 --> 14:03.200
No!

166
14:03.960 --> 14:06.480
You can't take Hathaya. She stays with me.

167
14:06.560 --> 14:08.160
Have you forgotten

168
14:08.800 --> 14:10.760
that you prevented Burapha and me

169
14:10.840 --> 14:12.880
from legally registering our marriage?

170
14:12.960 --> 14:15.480
You have no right to demand anything from me.

171
14:18.360 --> 14:21.800
Hathaya is the only thing I have left.

172
14:22.520 --> 14:24.680
I will not let my daughter

173
14:24.760 --> 14:27.360
stay with someone as narrow-minded as you.

174
14:29.400 --> 14:31.960
Where is Hathaya?

175
14:32.040 --> 14:33.680
Don't let her take Hathaya!

176
14:34.840 --> 14:35.920
Hathaya!

177
14:42.760 --> 14:45.200
Done! This is Hathaya's castle.

178
14:45.280 --> 14:47.200
Daddy, Mommy, and I

179
14:47.280 --> 14:49.920
all live together in our happy castle.

180
14:50.840 --> 14:54.480
Your castle is so pretty. I'll make a flower garden for you.

181
14:56.600 --> 14:58.480
I'm sorry.

182
14:59.640 --> 15:02.240
It's okay. If it falls down, we can build it again.

183
15:02.320 --> 15:04.560
I'll go ask Daddy to help us.

184
15:16.200 --> 15:17.800
Hathaya.

185
15:19.360 --> 15:20.720
Come with Aunt Liu.

186
15:28.280 --> 15:31.240
Hathaya. Hathaya.

187
15:31.760 --> 15:34.280
Hathaya. Hathaya, where are you?

188
15:34.920 --> 15:38.640
Hathaya! Can you hear Mommy, sweetheart?

189
15:39.560 --> 15:41.000
Hathaya!

190
15:41.080 --> 15:42.400
Sweetheart?

191
15:42.480 --> 15:44.160
-Where are you? -She's right here.

192
15:44.680 --> 15:46.040
What are you doing with her?!

193
15:46.920 --> 15:48.560
Take your daughter.

194
15:48.640 --> 15:50.920
Get out of here and never set foot in this house again.

195
15:52.480 --> 15:53.760
Go!

196
15:54.360 --> 15:57.160
Hathaya! Hathaya, where are you, sweetheart?

197
15:57.240 --> 15:59.960
Go! Go!

198
16:00.040 --> 16:01.360
Come on, sweetheart.

199
16:04.800 --> 16:06.520
Get out of my life!

200
16:09.160 --> 16:10.960
Come on. Get in.

201
16:12.960 --> 16:14.480
Hurry.

202
16:18.840 --> 16:20.360
Mommy, where are you taking me?

203
16:22.280 --> 16:23.520
I'm taking you on a trip.

204
16:23.600 --> 16:25.160
Aren't we bringing Daddy with us?

205
16:30.840 --> 16:31.800
Daddy's over there.

206
16:31.880 --> 16:33.760
-Father! -Hathai!

207
16:33.840 --> 16:36.400
Are Grandpa and Uncle Thot coming too?

208
16:36.480 --> 16:39.720
Hathai. Don't take my granddaughter away!

209
16:42.120 --> 16:43.960
-Don't take my granddaughter! -Father.

210
16:45.200 --> 16:46.520
Let her out!

211
16:48.320 --> 16:50.520
Don't take her! Let her go!

212
16:51.680 --> 16:52.800
Let her go!

213
16:52.880 --> 16:54.560
Father!

214
16:54.640 --> 16:56.200
Father!

215
16:57.040 --> 17:00.120
Grandpa! Grandpa!

216
17:01.320 --> 17:03.160
Father.

217
17:03.240 --> 17:06.040
You two, go after my granddaughter right now!

218
17:06.119 --> 17:07.400
-Hurry! -Yes, Father.

219
17:17.520 --> 17:18.880
Father.

220
17:19.880 --> 17:21.079
I'm fine.

221
17:21.160 --> 17:23.359
I'm all right.

222
17:28.200 --> 17:30.040
Daddy, where are you going?

223
17:30.640 --> 17:31.960
I'm going to bring Hathaya back.

224
17:32.040 --> 17:33.760
I'll wait for you, Daddy.

225
17:33.840 --> 17:35.200
I'll be back real soon.

226
17:35.280 --> 17:36.240
Okay.

227
17:44.520 --> 17:46.280
Chayanee, sweetheart. Come here.

228
18:06.520 --> 18:09.120
Mommy, I want to go home.

229
18:09.200 --> 18:12.240
I want to see Grandpa. I want Daddy.

230
18:12.840 --> 18:16.520
Be quiet. And don't mention any of them again.

231
18:16.600 --> 18:18.320
You're never going to see them again!

232
18:23.000 --> 18:24.440
I said be quiet!

233
18:39.760 --> 18:41.440
-Is that them? -Yes.

234
19:09.680 --> 19:11.240
Father!

235
19:11.320 --> 19:14.440
Hathai stole all my jewelry!

236
19:33.360 --> 19:34.520
That bitch Hathai!

237
20:03.360 --> 20:05.200
She searched the room, found the key,

238
20:06.320 --> 20:08.560
opened the safe, and took the cash

239
20:09.760 --> 20:11.320
and watches.

240
20:12.520 --> 20:14.400
She was already planning to leave.

241
20:17.200 --> 20:18.440
That damn parasite!

242
20:21.240 --> 20:23.280
You branded me a parasite

243
20:24.120 --> 20:26.200
who came here to suck you dry and take your money.

244
20:26.880 --> 20:29.160
Fine. I'll become exactly what you wanted me to be.

245
20:36.720 --> 20:37.560
DADDY

246
20:38.160 --> 20:41.200
It's Daddy. I want to talk to him!

247
20:43.360 --> 20:44.800
I told you to sit still!

248
20:49.480 --> 20:50.560
Hathai won't answer.

249
20:51.160 --> 20:53.680
The more you chase her, the faster she'll drive.

250
20:53.760 --> 20:55.080
An accident might happen.

251
20:55.160 --> 20:58.000
Why don't we go back home and wait? Let Hathai calm down first,

252
20:58.080 --> 20:59.840
then ask her to give your daughter back.

253
21:00.960 --> 21:02.480
I'm getting my daughter back.

254
21:06.240 --> 21:08.720
Spirits who guard this house,

255
21:08.800 --> 21:10.600
please let Hathai and her daughter

256
21:11.200 --> 21:14.280
die horrible deaths. Don't ever let them come back here again.

257
21:36.960 --> 21:39.440
If my prayer comes true,

258
21:39.520 --> 21:42.480
I'll offer you nine pig heads.

259
21:42.560 --> 21:44.160
Sadhu.

260
22:12.640 --> 22:14.280
Burapha!

261
22:45.760 --> 22:48.520
Here you go.

262
22:49.280 --> 22:52.240
Just before Hathai took Hathaya away,

263
22:53.440 --> 22:56.400
someone told me they saw you leading Hathaya somewhere.

264
22:59.520 --> 23:00.880
Is that true?

265
23:11.400 --> 23:12.280
Yes.

266
23:12.880 --> 23:15.800
I found Hathaya and was going to bring her to you.

267
23:15.880 --> 23:17.600
But Hathaya refused to come with me.

268
23:18.280 --> 23:19.600
She cried and threw a tantrum,

269
23:20.200 --> 23:21.840
saying she wanted to leave this house.

270
23:23.680 --> 23:27.600
She also said she hated everyone.

271
23:28.680 --> 23:30.080
She said she hated you too.

272
23:31.840 --> 23:33.600
Hathaya said that?

273
23:35.840 --> 23:37.720
I raised Miss Hathaya myself.

274
23:37.800 --> 23:40.240
She isn't rude enough to say something like that.

275
23:41.120 --> 23:43.120
She loves you very much, sir.

276
23:43.200 --> 23:46.080
Are you accusing me of lying about my own niece?

277
23:47.080 --> 23:48.360
Enough.

278
23:50.400 --> 23:53.360
Her mother must have poisoned her mind against me.

279
23:55.600 --> 23:56.960
Fine.

280
23:57.040 --> 24:00.120
If she wants to love her mother and believe her, then let her go.

281
24:00.800 --> 24:02.120
Ungrateful little brat.

282
24:04.200 --> 24:06.400
Call Burapha and Thotsaphon back.

283
24:06.480 --> 24:07.960
No need to go after them anymore.

284
24:10.200 --> 24:12.120
THOTSAPHON

285
24:13.000 --> 24:14.960
It's Thotsaphon.

286
24:17.040 --> 24:20.400
Hello? What?

287
24:21.520 --> 24:22.640
Rescue service?

288
24:24.720 --> 24:27.440
Why do you have my husband's phone?

289
24:31.400 --> 24:32.400
What happened?

290
24:34.520 --> 24:35.640
An accident?

291
24:37.120 --> 24:38.560
They're both dead?!

292
24:42.720 --> 24:44.280
Thotsaphon!

293
24:59.280 --> 25:01.320
Chayanee, sweetheart.

294
25:03.160 --> 25:04.520
Your father…

295
25:06.480 --> 25:09.640
Where's Daddy? Daddy said he was coming back to see me.

296
25:10.840 --> 25:13.680
Daddy isn't with us anymore, sweetheart.

297
25:20.480 --> 25:23.200
Why did you leave me?

298
26:02.360 --> 26:03.920
I have no one left.

299
26:07.040 --> 26:09.520
Both of my sons died because of you two.

300
26:13.800 --> 26:15.360
You're going to pay for this!

301
26:38.240 --> 26:41.360
15 YEARS LATER

302
27:04.040 --> 27:06.080
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

303
27:06.160 --> 27:08.240
-Enjoy your meal. -Thanks.

304
27:10.320 --> 27:11.840
MADE TO ORDER FOOD

305
27:11.920 --> 27:14.720
-Hathaya. -Yes, Grandma?

306
27:14.800 --> 27:15.840
Hi.

307
27:15.920 --> 27:18.040
-You're back already, sweetheart? -Let me help.

308
27:20.600 --> 27:22.920
You just got back from work and you're already cooking.

309
27:23.520 --> 27:25.040
Where's your mom?

310
27:26.120 --> 27:28.000
Mom said she went out to buy something.

311
27:28.080 --> 27:31.720
But she already asked me to buy everything. So where has she gone?

312
27:33.480 --> 27:36.120
Boy! You bitch! You vile bitch!

313
27:36.200 --> 27:39.280
Get out! How dare you steal my man?!

314
27:39.360 --> 27:41.880
Get out, you bitch! I'll kill you!

315
27:41.960 --> 27:43.320
-Mom! -You bitch!

316
27:43.400 --> 27:45.960
Mom, enough! Aren't you embarrassed?

317
27:46.040 --> 27:47.640
Why the hell should I be embarrassed?

318
27:47.720 --> 27:49.920
She stole my man. She's the one who should be ashamed!

319
27:51.320 --> 27:53.760
Boy! Boy!

320
27:53.840 --> 27:55.360
-Where are you going? -Let go of me.

321
27:55.440 --> 27:57.040
I'm going home.

322
27:57.120 --> 27:59.080
Boy, don't go.

323
27:59.160 --> 28:01.160
I've done everything you wanted.

324
28:01.240 --> 28:04.760
But you shouldn't have brought that woman into my room.

325
28:04.840 --> 28:06.120
So what?

326
28:06.200 --> 28:08.640
I've helped pay the rent on this house for years.

327
28:08.720 --> 28:11.080
You've been living off me all this time. You damn parasites.

328
28:11.160 --> 28:13.040
-That's not fair. -Boy.

329
28:13.120 --> 28:16.120
I earn enough to support my mom and grandma myself.

330
28:16.200 --> 28:18.400
You were the one who offered to help with the rent.

331
28:18.480 --> 28:19.760
In return, we kept the house

332
28:19.840 --> 28:21.080
and cooked for you.

333
28:22.000 --> 28:24.880
You have no right to hold it over our heads or insult us.

334
28:24.960 --> 28:26.640
I never wanted you to live here.

335
28:26.720 --> 28:28.360
Fine! Then I won't stay.

336
28:28.440 --> 28:29.920
-No, Boy! -Let go!

337
28:30.000 --> 28:32.280
-Don't leave me. -Mom.

338
28:32.360 --> 28:34.200
Mom, enough!

339
28:34.280 --> 28:36.920
Aren't you ashamed?

340
28:38.200 --> 28:41.560
You let people call us parasites like this and you're not ashamed at all?

341
28:41.640 --> 28:43.840
Ever since you brought me here,

342
28:43.920 --> 28:45.880
you gambled away all the money.

343
28:46.760 --> 28:49.120
You lived off one man after another.

344
28:49.200 --> 28:52.360
I can't take being branded a parasite anymore.

345
28:54.400 --> 28:58.040
Hey. You're my daughter. You have no right to lecture me!

346
29:01.040 --> 29:03.800
But I'm your mother, so I have every right to lecture you.

347
29:03.880 --> 29:05.280
Mom!

348
29:05.360 --> 29:08.920
-Mom. -Mom.

349
29:09.800 --> 29:11.400
Mom, enough.

350
29:11.920 --> 29:14.200
You need to learn how to stand on your own two feet.

351
29:14.280 --> 29:17.080
I invested my salary

352
29:17.160 --> 29:20.760
so you could run this food stall. You can survive on this.

353
29:20.840 --> 29:22.600
You don't have to gamble.

354
29:22.680 --> 29:26.440
And what then? I stand here cooking all day

355
29:26.520 --> 29:28.560
until my hair and clothes stink?

356
29:28.640 --> 29:30.560
And how much do I even make in a day?

357
29:30.640 --> 29:34.000
As soon as people saw, they started copying me and opening their own stalls.

358
29:35.200 --> 29:38.040
Why don't you ever consider that customers stopped coming

359
29:38.120 --> 29:39.960
because you don't take it seriously?

360
29:40.040 --> 29:43.960
You open one day, then close for two because you run off to gamble.

361
29:44.680 --> 29:46.600
You have to stop blaming everyone else.

362
29:47.640 --> 29:48.960
Fine!

363
29:49.040 --> 29:50.240
I'm terrible.

364
29:50.320 --> 29:54.200
There's nothing good about me. I'm stupid!

365
29:54.280 --> 29:57.320
Every man I get involved with accuses me of living off him.

366
29:57.400 --> 29:59.560
And in the end, they all leave me.

367
30:01.040 --> 30:03.440
Hathai, instead of admitting your mistakes

368
30:03.520 --> 30:05.600
and changing yourself,

369
30:05.680 --> 30:09.520
you deliberately sink even lower, just like what people say about you.

370
30:09.600 --> 30:12.280
How is your life ever going to get any better?

371
30:12.360 --> 30:14.240
Mom.

372
30:14.320 --> 30:18.080
I tried being good before. It didn't do me any good.

373
30:19.120 --> 30:20.680
There's no place in this world

374
30:20.760 --> 30:24.040
for a fool like me.

375
30:35.480 --> 30:37.240
I can't take it anymore.

376
30:39.480 --> 30:41.040
If you don't pay your debt today,

377
30:42.280 --> 30:43.320
you're dead!

378
30:47.120 --> 30:48.600
Mom!

379
30:48.680 --> 30:50.200
Hey! After her!

380
31:15.280 --> 31:16.240
You're not getting away.

381
31:18.160 --> 31:19.640
Please.

382
31:19.720 --> 31:21.560
Give me one more month.

383
31:21.640 --> 31:24.000
I'll pay everything back, principal and interest.

384
31:24.080 --> 31:26.040
How many times have you said that already?

385
31:26.120 --> 31:28.040
Just the other day, you were acting tough, saying,

386
31:28.120 --> 31:30.400
"No money, no running away, no paying."

387
31:30.480 --> 31:32.720
Please. I'm begging you.

388
31:32.800 --> 31:35.480
I'll get the money for you tomorrow. I swear.

389
31:35.560 --> 31:36.360
Bullshit!

390
31:36.440 --> 31:38.320
Wait!

391
31:39.640 --> 31:40.680
I'll pay you.

392
31:43.800 --> 31:45.080
She still owes 500,000 baht.

393
31:47.760 --> 31:49.720
This is really all I have right now.

394
31:50.360 --> 31:52.760
If my mom dies, you won't get anything at all.

395
31:52.840 --> 31:54.480
You've got one week.

396
31:55.520 --> 31:56.680
If you don't pay me by then,

397
31:57.520 --> 31:59.480
start preparing your mom's funeral.

398
31:59.560 --> 32:01.480
Let's go.

399
32:06.040 --> 32:07.920
Mom! Are you okay?

400
32:09.160 --> 32:11.120
Are you hurt?

401
32:27.760 --> 32:28.680
Hathaya.

402
32:30.320 --> 32:32.440
Please find the money to pay off my debt.

403
32:35.360 --> 32:37.360
Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?

404
32:38.840 --> 32:40.680
That money was my salary.

405
32:41.880 --> 32:45.600
As for my savings, you gambled it all away.

406
32:47.000 --> 32:50.960
Then go get it from your father's family.

407
33:01.480 --> 33:03.200
What are you talking about?

408
33:09.160 --> 33:11.520
Ever since the day you brought me here,

409
33:13.280 --> 33:15.200
you told me their house burned down.

410
33:17.960 --> 33:19.720
You said Dad, Grandpa,

411
33:21.480 --> 33:23.920
and everyone in that family died.

412
33:25.440 --> 33:26.600
Hathai!

413
33:27.120 --> 33:30.040
You lied to me? You lied to your own daughter?

414
33:32.800 --> 33:35.840
I was afraid she'd go looking for them.

415
33:35.920 --> 33:38.200
And I was afraid they'd call the police and have me arrested

416
33:38.280 --> 33:41.520
for stealing their money and valuables, Mom.

417
33:52.160 --> 33:54.360
You knew how much I missed Dad.

418
33:55.600 --> 33:56.720
How much I missed Grandpa.

419
33:58.680 --> 34:00.640
Why would you do this to me?

420
34:08.719 --> 34:11.080
If you miss them so much, then go see them.

421
34:11.600 --> 34:13.840
Go see them.

422
34:13.920 --> 34:15.199
And get their money for me.

423
34:15.280 --> 34:17.800
Please, Hathaya. Please, sweetheart.

424
34:19.360 --> 34:21.080
Hathaya, don't go.

425
34:21.679 --> 34:22.639
Mom!

426
34:22.719 --> 34:24.639
Stop using your daughter as a tool.

427
34:25.360 --> 34:28.320
You dragged her away and made her live a life of hardship.

428
34:28.400 --> 34:30.400
You stole from that family.

429
34:30.480 --> 34:32.960
You really are selfish.

430
34:33.040 --> 34:36.120
They were right to call you a parasite. And now you're trying

431
34:37.040 --> 34:38.800
to send your own daughter back there

432
34:38.880 --> 34:41.400
to be a parasite just like you were.

433
34:42.000 --> 34:43.080
Enough.

434
34:43.159 --> 34:45.560
Take responsibility for once.

435
34:46.159 --> 34:47.800
So you want to see me die?

436
34:47.880 --> 34:50.280
Then stop gambling and get a job!

437
34:50.880 --> 34:53.239
Where am I supposed to get

438
34:53.320 --> 34:57.280
five hundred thousand to pay them, Mom? They only gave me one week.

439
34:57.840 --> 35:00.040
And the reason I gamble

440
35:00.120 --> 35:02.000
is for you and for Hathaya.

441
35:02.080 --> 35:05.760
I wanted to win big. I wanted enough money to take care of both of you.

442
35:05.840 --> 35:08.720
Stop using other people as an excuse.

443
35:08.800 --> 35:11.680
Everything you've done has been for yourself.

444
35:13.040 --> 35:16.200
Hathaya, come with Grandma. Come on, sweetheart.

445
35:24.680 --> 35:28.680
You're ungrateful! After everything I've done for you!

446
35:36.280 --> 35:38.080
You really want to see me dead, don't you?

447
35:39.320 --> 35:42.840
Fine. Then I'll just die. You can watch me die.

448
35:42.920 --> 35:45.400
Don't give in.

449
35:45.480 --> 35:48.480
Someone that selfish would never kill herself.

450
35:56.520 --> 35:59.000
-Mom. -Let go.

451
35:59.080 --> 36:01.000
Please, Mom!

452
36:01.080 --> 36:04.800
Please stop doing this. I'm begging you.

453
36:04.880 --> 36:08.120
Fine. Then promise me

454
36:08.200 --> 36:09.320
you'll help me.

455
36:09.400 --> 36:10.880
Promise me!

456
36:10.960 --> 36:13.680
Okay! I promise.

457
36:13.760 --> 36:15.920
I promise I'll help you.

458
36:16.000 --> 36:18.760
But you can't ever do this again.

459
36:22.520 --> 36:23.800
-Mom! -Grandma!

460
36:27.200 --> 36:29.240
Doctor, nurse, please.

461
36:30.320 --> 36:31.880
What's wrong with my grandma?

462
36:59.040 --> 37:00.200
Hathaya, sweetheart,

463
37:00.800 --> 37:03.080
we need to find money for Grandma's treatment

464
37:03.160 --> 37:05.960
before her condition gets worse.

465
37:09.080 --> 37:11.520
Hathaya.

466
37:11.600 --> 37:15.360
Go back to your father. Go see Grandpa too.

467
37:15.440 --> 37:17.600
Ask them for a million.

468
37:17.680 --> 37:19.520
I'll use some of it to pay off the debt

469
37:19.600 --> 37:23.200
and the rest for Grandma's treatment.

470
37:27.920 --> 37:31.040
I promise I'll stop gambling.

471
37:31.120 --> 37:33.600
And I'll stop finding new men.

472
37:34.320 --> 37:36.040
If I'm lying,

473
37:36.120 --> 37:38.840
may I die within three or seven days.

474
37:38.920 --> 37:42.120
Please, Hathaya. Go see your father. Go see Grandpa.

475
37:42.200 --> 37:45.120
Bring back the money so we can pay for Grandma's treatment.

476
37:47.000 --> 37:48.480
Grandma.

477
37:51.200 --> 37:53.920
I'm going back to find Dad and Grandpa.

478
37:57.560 --> 37:59.560
Please wait for me.

479
38:00.080 --> 38:02.640
I'll get the money to pay for your treatment.

480
38:04.160 --> 38:05.320
Good.

481
38:06.360 --> 38:08.760
Thank you, Hathaya.

482
38:09.280 --> 38:10.520
Thank you, sweetheart.

483
38:15.600 --> 38:16.840
Mom.

484
38:31.280 --> 38:33.680
Ramil, what are you doing here?

485
38:33.760 --> 38:37.400
What are you doing here, Mr. Saksit?

486
38:38.000 --> 38:41.120
Don't get smart with me. I'm not one of your buddies.

487
38:41.200 --> 38:43.320
Dad and I came to wish Mr. Pichai a happy birthday.

488
38:44.520 --> 38:46.440
I brought the workers to wish him a happy birthday too.

489
38:48.240 --> 38:51.880
Good grief. Look at the state of them.

490
38:52.840 --> 38:53.960
You should know better.

491
38:54.040 --> 38:57.480
Your workers are filthy and covered in grime.

492
38:58.360 --> 39:00.720
This event is for important guests only.

493
39:00.800 --> 39:04.160
Take your dirty workers back to work. Go on.

494
39:05.880 --> 39:08.320
Hello, Chief.

495
39:10.760 --> 39:12.880
-Hello. -Hello, Mr. Pichai.

496
39:12.960 --> 39:14.160
Hello.

497
39:15.960 --> 39:17.440
Mr. Pichai.

498
39:18.440 --> 39:22.120
This is my son, Raiwin. He earned his Master's in Business.

499
39:22.200 --> 39:25.240
I'm planning to send him abroad for a course in public administration as well.

500
39:25.320 --> 39:29.440
After he comes back, I'll have him run for subdistrict chief to take over from me.

501
39:29.520 --> 39:32.880
Then he can work his way up into national politics.

502
39:32.960 --> 39:34.560
Wow.

503
39:35.400 --> 39:38.440
That's a good plan. Those are impressive qualifications.

504
39:38.520 --> 39:40.480
Come back soon and help your father with his work.

505
39:41.000 --> 39:42.600
At this rate, I may have to start getting

506
39:42.680 --> 39:45.080
on the good side of the future chief already.

507
39:45.160 --> 39:46.760
Oh.

508
39:46.840 --> 39:50.200
I'm the one who should be asking for your support, Mr. Pichai.

509
39:50.280 --> 39:52.480
I hope people from my generation

510
39:52.560 --> 39:54.400
can help develop our community.

511
39:56.400 --> 39:57.360
So…

512
39:57.440 --> 39:58.640
-Shall we go inside? -Sir.

513
39:59.280 --> 40:02.800
The workers would like to wish you a happy birthday too.

514
40:02.880 --> 40:05.200
Of course. Thank you.

515
40:05.280 --> 40:07.160
Thank you, everyone.

516
40:08.320 --> 40:09.360
The flowers are beautiful.

517
40:10.680 --> 40:12.040
May I take a picture?

518
40:13.000 --> 40:14.800
Of course. Come on, everyone.

519
40:14.880 --> 40:16.920
Come over here.

520
40:17.680 --> 40:21.000
Chief, and our future chief,

521
40:21.080 --> 40:22.240
please join us.

522
40:26.920 --> 40:28.600
One, two…

523
40:29.640 --> 40:32.320
Chief, give us a smile. Come on, smile.

524
40:35.600 --> 40:37.640
One, two, three.

525
40:37.720 --> 40:41.600
One, two, three. Very handsome, Chief. You too, sir.

526
40:41.680 --> 40:43.920
One, two, three.

527
40:44.000 --> 40:46.960
Chief, look at the camera. Smile, Chief.

528
40:47.040 --> 40:48.680
Come on. Give us a smile.

529
40:55.440 --> 40:58.360
Father, everything is ready inside.

530
40:59.120 --> 41:00.240
Please come in.

531
41:00.320 --> 41:01.880
Let's go.

532
41:01.960 --> 41:03.360
Let's go inside.

533
41:11.880 --> 41:12.960
Wait.

534
41:18.200 --> 41:20.760
Father's housing development project is behind schedule.

535
41:20.840 --> 41:22.000
Get back to work.

536
41:22.600 --> 41:23.440
Oh!

537
41:23.520 --> 41:24.960
And if there's any food left over,

538
41:25.040 --> 41:27.200
I'll have someone pack it up and send it to you.

539
41:27.280 --> 41:29.000
Now go. Get back to work.

540
41:32.000 --> 41:33.080
Max,

541
41:33.160 --> 41:36.040
take the workers out for barbecue first, then head back to the site.

542
41:43.920 --> 41:44.840
Go on.

543
41:45.400 --> 41:47.440
-Come on, guys. -Let's go.

544
41:48.320 --> 41:49.520
Hey.

545
41:50.280 --> 41:53.480
You're the foreman. Shouldn't you be supervising them?

546
41:54.080 --> 41:55.760
Ms. Liu, you don't know about me.

547
41:56.680 --> 41:58.760
I'm only pretending to be a foreman.

548
41:58.840 --> 42:01.160
But actually, I'm--

549
42:02.560 --> 42:05.960
Don't tell me you're secretly the company president.

550
42:06.560 --> 42:09.480
-No. -I'm a beggar.

551
42:09.560 --> 42:12.680
-Spare some money, please. -You're insane!

552
42:12.760 --> 42:14.080
I'm not your friend.

553
42:15.520 --> 42:18.560
Father should never have hired a lunatic like him.

554
42:18.640 --> 42:22.200
Just wait. One day I'll throw him out myself.

555
42:22.800 --> 42:26.480
Madam, would you like me to drag him back out by the hair?

556
42:26.560 --> 42:29.120
No. You stay here.

557
42:29.200 --> 42:32.640
Don't let any low-class people into the party.

558
42:32.720 --> 42:33.800
Yes, ma'am.

559
42:37.800 --> 42:40.520
Don't let any low-class people into the party.

560
42:59.040 --> 43:01.080
All right, everyone.

561
43:03.560 --> 43:06.000
Today marks Father's

562
43:06.080 --> 43:07.960
72nd birthday.

563
43:08.040 --> 43:11.280
All of us, his children, grandchildren, family, and dear friends,

564
43:11.360 --> 43:13.080
would like to wish him

565
43:13.160 --> 43:15.360
the greatest happiness.

566
43:15.440 --> 43:17.840
And now, please enjoy

567
43:17.920 --> 43:22.040
a very special performance.

568
43:22.560 --> 43:26.360
Happy birthday to you

569
43:27.480 --> 43:30.920
Happy birthday to you

570
43:31.680 --> 43:35.640
Happy birthday, happy birthday

571
43:35.720 --> 43:39.200
Happy birthday to you

572
43:40.160 --> 43:43.120
Happy birthday to you

573
43:44.480 --> 43:47.600
Happy birthday to you

574
43:49.200 --> 43:50.840
Happy birthday…

575
43:59.240 --> 44:02.280
Happy birthday

576
44:23.720 --> 44:25.400
Hey, hey.

577
44:26.800 --> 44:29.360
Who are you? What are you doing here?

578
44:31.600 --> 44:33.120
Hmm.

579
44:33.200 --> 44:35.800
Look at you, dragging a suitcase around.

580
44:35.880 --> 44:37.880
You obviously weren't invited to Master's party.

581
44:39.160 --> 44:41.760
-I'm here to-- -Apply for a job?

582
44:41.840 --> 44:45.320
Turn around and leave. We're not hiring maids here.

583
44:45.400 --> 44:48.120
I'm not here to apply for a job, Aunt Chamoi.

584
44:48.720 --> 44:49.560
Oh?

585
44:50.080 --> 44:53.160
You know my name? Who are you?

586
44:54.480 --> 44:56.240
Oh.

587
44:56.320 --> 44:59.160
You're a scammer, aren't you?

588
44:59.240 --> 45:01.760
You researched me, so you could come here and con me!

589
45:01.840 --> 45:04.080
Get out! Go!

590
45:04.160 --> 45:07.760
Please let me inside. I came to wish Grandpa a happy birthday.

591
45:07.840 --> 45:11.280
You know that too? You really did your research.

592
45:11.360 --> 45:13.000
You professional little con artist.

593
45:13.080 --> 45:15.920
Get out of Master Pichai's house right now.

594
45:16.000 --> 45:17.160
-Out! -Please let me inside.

595
45:17.240 --> 45:19.680
No! Over my dead body

596
45:19.760 --> 45:21.160
am I letting you in!

597
45:27.440 --> 45:29.040
Grandpa's little angel

598
45:29.120 --> 45:32.000
wishes you the most wonderful birthday ever.

599
45:32.680 --> 45:35.600
I hope you're very happy and stay strong and healthy

600
45:35.680 --> 45:37.920
so you can be with all of us for a long, long time.

601
45:38.000 --> 45:39.560
And most importantly,

602
45:39.640 --> 45:42.360
Grandpa has to love this granddaughter more than anyone else.

603
45:45.160 --> 45:46.800
Grandpa only has one granddaughter.

604
45:47.560 --> 45:49.880
And Chayanee is the granddaughter I love most.

605
45:51.640 --> 45:52.600
You're not coming in!

606
45:52.680 --> 45:54.240
I said you're not coming in!

607
45:54.320 --> 45:56.640
-I said you can't come in! -Okay. Fine.

608
45:58.640 --> 46:00.600
Make a wish, Father.

609
46:00.680 --> 46:03.080
I don't think I need to wish for anything anymore.

610
46:03.680 --> 46:05.200
I have wonderful colleagues

611
46:05.280 --> 46:07.280
and good friends.

612
46:07.880 --> 46:11.680
And I wish all of you happiness as well.

613
46:12.600 --> 46:14.320
Blow out the candles, Grandpa.

614
46:17.160 --> 46:19.440
You can't go in there! Come back here right now!

615
46:35.240 --> 46:36.400
Who are you?

616
46:42.200 --> 46:44.080
Get up. Come on. Get up.

617
46:46.640 --> 46:48.000
Have we met before?

618
46:49.360 --> 46:50.720
Grandpa.

619
46:52.640 --> 46:53.720
My name is Hathaya.

620
47:09.000 --> 47:10.320
Hathaya.

621
47:11.520 --> 47:14.560
I'm Burapha and Hathai's daughter.

622
47:17.840 --> 47:19.400
Hathaya?

623
47:25.880 --> 47:27.200
You…

624
47:34.880 --> 47:36.240
I missed you so much, Grandpa.

625
47:36.320 --> 47:38.440
I love you more than anyone in the world.

626
47:45.680 --> 47:46.960
You are not my granddaughter.

627
47:51.000 --> 47:51.840
Who's that?

628
47:54.600 --> 47:56.680
I'm Hathaya, Grandpa.

629
47:57.520 --> 47:59.200
I'm your granddaughter.

630
47:59.960 --> 48:03.200
My granddaughter died along with that wicked mother of hers.

631
48:04.360 --> 48:05.640
They're both dead to me.

632
48:11.360 --> 48:13.600
I know what my mom did,

633
48:14.760 --> 48:17.320
and I know how angry you are with her.

634
48:18.280 --> 48:19.840
But I wanted to come back to you.

635
48:20.480 --> 48:22.640
Ever since the day you two left this house,

636
48:23.680 --> 48:25.560
we considered you dead.

637
48:32.360 --> 48:34.200
So consider us dead too.

638
48:34.280 --> 48:36.560
In this life or the next, I never want to see you.

639
48:41.040 --> 48:43.280
Get out. Get out!

640
48:45.240 --> 48:48.640
If you don't want me, that's okay.

641
48:49.240 --> 48:50.360
I'll leave.

642
48:55.440 --> 48:56.560
Oh no!

643
48:56.640 --> 48:58.080
-Grandpa! -Father!

644
48:58.160 --> 48:59.440
Father.

645
48:59.520 --> 49:01.600
-Call an ambulance. -Grandpa!

646
49:12.240 --> 49:13.520
You say you love Grandpa.

647
49:13.600 --> 49:15.240
NEXT EPISODE

648
49:15.320 --> 49:17.960
Then give him what he wants.

649
49:18.840 --> 49:20.920
Get out of his life.

650
49:21.000 --> 49:23.480
What do you really want by coming back here?

651
49:23.560 --> 49:26.800
I admit that I'm in trouble, Grandpa.

652
49:28.800 --> 49:31.280
I'm going to teach her pain and suffering

653
49:31.360 --> 49:33.320
far worse than anything her mother ever put me through.

654
49:35.000 --> 49:36.840
I'm going to make her trust me.

655
49:37.440 --> 49:40.000
I'll play the part of the sweet little angel.

656
49:40.080 --> 49:43.680
And when the time comes, I'll drag her straight down to hell.

657
51:37.920 --> 51:39.960
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
